#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:5 44f5cc2bf4b146068c1948c3aaa74b1c
msgid "Throw Mode"
msgstr "Throw 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:7 db3f27934e4f489496f31bfc40844556
msgid ""
"This slightly dangerous flight mode allows the pilot to throw the vehicle "
"into the air (or drop the vehicle) in order to start the motors. Once in the"
" air, this mode does not accept any input from the pilot.  This mode "
"requires GPS."
msgstr "这个略有危险的飞行模式允许飞手将飞行器抛向空中（或投掷）以启动电机。飞行器入空后，此模式不接受飞手的任何输入。此模式需要 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:12 900e9caf726845f8829112be750a7b80
msgid "This flight mode is available for multirotors only."
msgstr "此飞行模式仅适用于多旋翼飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:16 4de03eec718046db9dbb0660ce31ba0f
msgid ""
"Use with caution!  It is dangerous to get close to an armed multicopter as "
"is required to throw the vehicle.  It is recommended to takeoff normally "
"instead of using throw mode whenever possible."
msgstr "请谨慎使用！抛投飞行器时需要靠近已解锁的多旋翼，这存在危险。建议尽可能使用正常起飞而非 Throw 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:22 ef039420211a43f28e4e4232f50ecd72
msgid "How To Use"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:24 adf039f400cb418c93042555676ab9c4
msgid "Disarm copter"
msgstr "飞机上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:25 ee9989d9622949819c45a042af320985
msgid "Switch to throw mode"
msgstr "切换到 Throw 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:26 f8dda4959c1d4e83bcc26ee2e49b69ee
msgid "Check GPS light is green"
msgstr "确认 GPS 指示灯为绿色"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:27 496681859d394dfdb85b6dc8e70dfd3a
msgid ""
"Arm copter and listen for ready tune (if vehicle has a buzzer).  The motors "
"will not spin by default."
msgstr "解锁飞机并等待就绪提示音（如果飞行器有蜂鸣器）。电机默认不会旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:28 968550752fbe42ad9739b707b2560ec0
msgid ""
"Pick up the vehicle and throw it up and away from you (it must climb by "
"50cm/s and reach a total speed of 5m/s)"
msgstr "拿起飞行器，将其斜向上方抛出（必须以 50cm/s 的速度爬升并达到 5m/s 的总速度）"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:29 b0978df33fcd4f989edd4a8997f437a7
msgid ""
"Once the vehicle has stopped, switch the flight mode to Loiter (or other "
"mode) to retake manual control"
msgstr "飞行器停稳后，将飞行模式切换到 Loiter（或其他模式）以重新获得手动控制权"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:31 8860a451368a46d68e8915c043c984e0
msgid ""
"The motors should start when the vehicle reaches the apex of it's "
"trajectory. After the motors start this flight mode will first try to "
"control it's attitude (return to level and stop rotating), then stop "
"descending and finally it will attempt to stop moving horizontally."
msgstr "电机应在飞行器到达抛射弧线顶点时启动。电机启动后，此飞行模式将首先尝试控制姿态（恢复水平并停止旋转），然后停止下降，最后尝试停止水平移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:35 00fa0c1bc01a4eb291294b3a61aa21df
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:36 a08eef7d6b7b498d8aec5dafed33207e
msgid ""
":ref:`THROW_TYPE <THROW_TYPE>`: set to 0 if throwing the vehicle up, 1 if "
"dropping the vehicle.  If dropping, drop from a height of at least 10m."
msgstr ""
":ref:`THROW_TYPE <THROW_TYPE>`：向上抛投时设置为 0，投落时设置为 1。如果是投落，请从至少 10m 的高度投落。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:37 28773cb51b13497191839ff9e4edb2a5
msgid ""
":ref:`THROW_MOT_START <THROW_MOT_START>`: controls whether the motors will "
"spin slowly or not at all while waiting for the throw (0 = stopped, 1 = "
"spinning slowly).  The default is 0 (will not spin after arming)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`THROW_MOT_START <THROW_MOT_START>`：控制等待抛投时电机是否缓慢旋转（0 = 停止，1 = "
"缓慢旋转）。默认值为 0（解锁后不旋转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:38 7cd946cf45544092939736dc05d25f44
msgid ""
":ref:`THROW_NEXTMODE <THROW_NEXTMODE>`: the vehicle will switch into this "
"flight mode after stopping (Auto, Guided, RTL, Land and Brake are support)."
"  Set to \"Throw\" (the default) to simply remain in Throw mode and wait for"
" the pilot to switch modes manually"
msgstr ""
":ref:`THROW_NEXTMODE <THROW_NEXTMODE>`：停稳后飞行器将切换到此飞行模式（支持 "
"Auto、Guided、RTL、Land 和 Brake）。设置为\"Throw\"（默认值）可使飞行器保持在 Throw 模式中，等待飞手手动切换模式"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:39 b45135817987421493ced409558204f1
msgid ""
":ref:`THROW_ALT_MIN<THROW_ALT_MIN>` and :ref:`THROW_ALT_MAX<THROW_ALT_MAX>`:"
" set the altitude limits for THROW mode launch. Throw must happen above the "
"minimum and below the maximum altitude above home after arming. Useful for "
"plane or balloon drop launches, allowing arming on ground to establish home "
"altitude, then rising in secondary release vehicle and dropping to launch."
msgstr ""
":ref:`THROW_ALT_MIN<THROW_ALT_MIN>` 和 :ref:`THROW_ALT_MAX<THROW_ALT_MAX>`：设置"
" Throw 模式发射的高度限制。抛投必须在解锁后离 Home 点的最低和最高高度之间进行。适用于固定翼或气球投落发射，允许在地面解锁建立 Home "
"高度后，随二次发射飞行器上升并投落启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:45 52817d830caa419f87b15fde4a137918
msgid "Log Analysis"
msgstr "日志分析"

#: ../../source/docs/throw-mode.rst:46 bb13486c63214ab88cba4331a8da4144
msgid ""
"During the throw, THRO messages are written to the :ref:`dataflash log "
"<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`.  These can"
" be useful in diagnosing problems in case the motors failed to start as part"
" of a throw.  The graph below shows a successful throw in which the overall "
"velocity climbs above 5m/s and the vertical velocity is over 0.5m/s."
msgstr ""
"抛投过程中，THRO 消息会写入 :ref:`dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-"
"logs-in-mission-planner>`。这些信息在诊断抛投时电机未能启动的问题时非常有用。下图显示了一次成功的抛投，其中总速度超过 "
"5m/s，垂直速度超过 0.5m/s。"
